	(descr "Abracon AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T 3.3 uH 2016. Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T.pdf (rev A 9/13/2024) p4 'Mechanical Specifications' (2.00 x 1.60, electrodes 0.60+-0.20) and 'Recommended Land Pattern' (1.00 x 1.60 lands, 1.00 gap). lands x 0.30..1.10 cover the 0.40..1.00 (0.60 nominal, 0.80 max -> 0.20..1.00) end electrodes. DENSE: budget envelope L2016 2.2 x 1.8 vs recommended 3.0 x 1.6: lands 0.80 x 1.60 at +-0.70 (2.20 overall, toe 0.10 past the body, inner gap 0.60 under the insulated body centre). Corrected copy of OpenDrone:IND-SMD_L2.0-W1.6_AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/IND-SMD_L2.0-W1.6_AOTA-B201610S3R3-101-T_Dense.json")
